#: manual/api/bin_float.md:75
msgid "removed from binary types; use explicit constructors"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float.md:77
msgid "The change is intentionally limited to the binary and ball stacks. Decimal and Semantic continue to expose their documented `BigInt` boundaries."
