#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:1
msgid "`bin_float_checked` API"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:3
msgid "`BinFloatResult` wraps `Result[BinFloat, ArithmeticError]` and keeps checked binary arithmetic closed over one type."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:8
msgid "`ok`, `err`, and `from_result` wrap existing outcomes."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:9
msgid "`from_int`, `from_coefficient`, `from_float`, and `from_double` create successful values."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:10
msgid "`result` exposes the wrapped `Result` at an application boundary."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:12
msgid "Composition"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:14
msgid "`map` applies a non-failing `BinFloat -> BinFloat` transform to `Ok` values."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:15
msgid "`bind` and `flat_map` apply a `BinFloat -> BinFloatResult` transform."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:16
msgid "Existing errors short-circuit all composition methods."
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:18
msgid "Numeric Operations"
msgstr ""

#: manual/api/bin_float_checked.md:20
msgid "`abs`, `neg`, `add`, `sub`, `mul`, `div`, `sqrt`, `pow_nat`, `pow_int`, `normalized`, `with_precision`, `ulp`, `min`, `max`, and labeled-argument `clamp` all return `BinFloatResult`. Operators `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, and unary `-` delegate to the corresponding methods."
msgstr ""

