#: manual/api/decimal_checked.md:9
msgid "`parse` and the `from_*` constructors apply the supplied context after forcing its IEEE profile. `value`, `context`, `raised`, and `flags` expose each state component; `outcome` returns the value with accumulated flags. `clear_flags` starts a new observation window without changing the value or context."
