#: manual/architecture.md:172
msgid "Extension Rule"
msgstr ""

#: manual/architecture.md:174
msgid "Add behavior to the package that owns its semantics. Reuse existing arithmetic capability traits before creating an umbrella trait. Keep kernels private, contexts/effects explicit, and external-format parsing outside numeric values unless the format is a stable interchange contract."
msgstr ""

#: manual/architecture.md:179
msgid "Extending a conformance surface requires coordinated parser, executor, support classification, CLI schema, manifest, test, generated-interface, and localized documentation changes. Parsing a new operation is not support until strict execution has a defined comparison and reproducible evidence."
