#: manual/conventions.md:7
msgid "Chapters and guides"
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:9
msgid "Each documented package has one page per chapter, named after its package path:"
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:11
msgid "**API reference (`api/<package>.md`)** specifies public types, functions, methods, errors, and observable semantics."
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:13
msgid "**Tutorial (`tutorial/<package>.md`)** provides small executable workflows and usage guidance."
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:15
msgid "**Design (`design/<package>.md`)** explains representation, invariants, responsibility boundaries, and implementation tradeoffs."
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:17
msgid "**Conformance (`conformance/<package>.md`)** defines a pinned finite evidence claim and its exclusions for each numerical core: `bin_float`, `decimal`, `decimal_gda`, and `ball_float`."
msgstr ""

#: manual/conventions.md:20
msgid "**Performance (`performance/<package>.md`)** records reproducible measurements and target-specific dispatch evidence for the same cores without making API promises."
